// EXACT RESIDUAL — 841 words, in five blocks. None of it is a scheduling
// or regalloc problem; it is code m2c could not decompile at all:
//  A. AngleS: the three 4x4 products after fn_80003E0C / EB0 / F54.
//     0x800B8F84..0x800B97F0, 539 words. Each output element is a 4-term
//     dot product (3 lfs + 1 fmuls + 3 fmadds + 1 stfs); 16 elements per
//     arm. The C below has all 12 scalar outputs (spA8..spE4) but only the
//     9 that survived m2c; the other 3 per arm and all the psq_l/psq_st
//     pair stores (offsets 0xB0/0xB8/0xC0/0xC8, 0xD0/0xD8/0xE0/0xE8) are
//     gone. This is 64% of the missing bytes.
