//  C. The four weighted-accumulate loops (centre-of-mass default,
//     model offset x2, constraint weight), 0x800B9A00..0x800B9C88.
//     4 elements x 4-term dot each, 8 words per element, ~130 words.
//  D. The 212 primary-opcode-4 / PS words in the function: the two OBB
//     pair copies into arg0+0x118/+0x120 (0x800B82A8), the inertia-tensor
//     pair scale (0x800B8474), the box pair round-trip through
